Revision history of WwW-SiteConf-Ninja


0.03_00  2026-11-24  RC
    (AI-generated.)

    First release on its own.  The ninja generator was
    RdKw::WwW::SiteConf::Ninja, in WwW-SiteConf; it is now
    RdKw::WwW::SiteConf::Builder::Ninja, here.
    * A marker's directory is made with mkdir -- DIR, so a
      directory that begins with - is made too.  -Smkpath=1 makes no
      markers; each command begins with mkdir -p -- DIR &&.
      -Scmd_mkdir and -Scmd_mkdir_p set those commands, as for
      make, with a $ in them the shell's.
